# The local planner: Qwen3 4B Instruct (2507), text only, with a 12k context.
#
# Why a text model: the planner is only ever sent text (the page as element
# lines), never an image. The previous local planner was Qwen3-VL 4B, a
# vision model, which spends its 4B parameters on seeing as well as
# reasoning; this one spends them all on text, and is 2.5 GB instead of
# 3.3 GB on the 6 GB laptop GPU.
#
# Why 12k: Ollama's default context is 4096 tokens, and over the
# OpenAI-compatible API it cannot be raised per request, so a real page was
# cut from the front (see CLAUDE.md, Gotchas). At 16k the VL model's cache
# did not fit beside it and a third ran on the CPU, 3x slower. The cache
# costs about 150 KB a token here, so 12k is about 1.8 GB. The server fits
# each request to 10,000 tokens for Ollama (src/config.ts), leaving room
# for the answer.
#
# Make it once:  ollama pull qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M
#                pnpm ollama:setup
FROM qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M
PARAMETER num_ctx 12288
